  m_text: "<size=8> </size>\n<color=yellow>Game by                           Mod
    by</color>\nipodtouch0218                 vlco_o\n\n<size=14>With thanks to the
    MvLO and vcmi Discord servers\nfor suggestions and bug reports.</size>\n\n<color=yellow>Playtesting                    
    Features & Content</color>\nmiyameo                                         
    IvythePoS\nFlichka                                                miyameo\nBilhal                                              
    Just Steve\nromanian dumbass                          super0410\nIvythePoS                                   
    FrostyCake\nWega                                                  ArianLust\nzomblebobble                                                   
    <size=0>.</size>\nakselai                                                               
    <size=0>.</size>\n\n<color=red>Vanilla Credits\n\n</color><size=12><color=yellow>Github
    Contributors</color>\nGradedWarrior\nTheMoogle\nSkillz\nSkarph\nZest\nkittenchilly\nAmy54Desu\nKraken\nShadowWalker13\nPerez\nmindnomad\n\n<color=yellow>Music</color>\nRENREN\n\n<color=yellow>QA
    Testing</color>\nTheCyVap\nShadow_Walker13\n\n<color=yellow>Level Design</color>\nSkarph\nTheCyVap\nmindnomad\n\n<color=yellow>Original
    Game / Resources</color>\nNSMB/NSMBWii\nMario Kart DS\nSuper Mario Maker 2\nNintendogs\n(c)
    Nintendo\nSMW Central\n\n<color=yellow>Asset Rippers</color>\nDemon2Warrior (Background)\r\nVentureSonic
    (Background)\r\nKeira (Background)\nOhthatguy (Background)\nPoudink (Tiles)\r\nSomeone
    (Tiles)\r\nHiccup (Tiles)\r\nJouv (Tiles)\r\nMr-SUGOI (Tiles)\nmindnomad (Tiles/Sound)\n\rSymbolcom
    (Enemies)\r\nMr. C (Enemies)\r\nRagey (Enemies)\r\nTechokami (Enemies)\r\n\rA
    Refracted Swindler (UI)\r\nTreeki (UI)\r\n\rDouble S (Models)\r\nKartMakerBrosU
    (Models)\r\nTeridaxXD001 (Models)\r\nSkarph (Models/Sound)\r\nLukeWarnut (Sound)\r\nLuke
    Hackett (Sound)\r\nmindnomad (Sound)\n "
